message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Transformer risk models for acute liver failure on MIMIC-IV"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of FT-Transformer and Hybrid Transformer models for
  in-hospital mortality prediction in acute liver failure, with a common
  statistical evaluation framework covering discrimination, calibration,
  decision curve analysis, non-linearity testing and reproducibility.
